- **Built on:** [TinyHarness](https://github.com/darthdemono/TinyHarness), an Apache-2.0 library for the tool-calling loop, the model client and the web page. Everything specific to this project is in `app.py` and the files next to it.

## Run it

```
pip install -e .
tinyharness doctor                 # what this machine can run
tinyharness setup                  # fetch the local engine once
python app.py serve                # chat page on http://127.0.0.1:8080
```

